<title>INDIA: Indian ad hoc t-bills at 61.65 bln rupees on Mar 6.</title>
<headline>Indian ad hoc t-bills at 61.65 bln rupees on Mar 6.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said on Tuesday the net issue of ad hoc treasury bills on March 6, 1997 over the March 31, 1996 level, was 61.65 billion rupees, up from 11.65 billion the previous week.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
